# Navigation and Rollout Rules

- Sidebar source of truth is `src/config/admin-nav.ts`.
- Enable nav items only for implemented, accessible routes.
- Keep planned-but-unimplemented sections as `enabled: false`.
- Ensure `match` mode (`exact`/`prefix`) aligns with route behavior.
- When adding a new route, update nav state intentionally (enabled or disabled) in the same change.
